OL,3,GNEWSAParents' plea for kidney
OL,4,Atransplant for daughter
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll Radhika wanted was for her little
OL,7,Ffour-year-old daughter Aryia to have a
OL,8,Fnormal childhood.
OL,10,FAryia has complete kidney failure and
OL,11,Frelies on a dialysis machine to keep
OL,12,Fher alive.
OL,14,FHowever, doctors have warned her
OL,15,Fparents that time is running out before
OL,16,Fher home dialysis ceases to be
OL,17,Feffective.
OL,19,FRadhika, who lives in Windsor, said: "I
OL,20,Fjust pray there is a match for my
OL,21,Fgirl."
